  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Located in the heart of Seagrove Beach, Beach Bungalow offers an authentic Gulf-front experience with timeless charm and modern comfort. Originally built in 1953 and completely renovated, this three-bedroom, two-bathroom coastal retreat accommodates up to eight guests and features private beach access, a spacious Gulf-view porch, and an unbeatable location just minutes from Seaside.<br><br>Highlights<br>– Gulf Front<br>– Private Beach Access<br>– 4 Adult Bikes Included in Rental<br>– Parking for 3 Vehicles<br>– Outdoor Couch and Umbrella Lounge<br>– Gas Grill<br>– Convenient Location to Local Restaurants and Shops<br>– 5-Minute Bike Ride to Seaside Square<br><br>Welcome to Beach Bungalow, a peaceful beachfront haven where coastal history meets relaxed sophistication. This bright and inviting Seagrove Beach retreat offers open living spaces, classic design elements, and panoramic views of the emerald Gulf waters.<br><br>The main living area provides a comfortable space to gather, featuring plush white sofas and large windows that fill the home with natural light. The adjoining kitchen is equipped with stainless-steel appliances, quartz countertops, and casual bar seating, creating a perfect setting for preparing meals or enjoying morning coffee with an ocean view.<br><br>The primary bedroom features a king bed and private bathroom with a shower/tub combination. Down the hallway, a queen bedroom and a spacious bunk room with two twin-over-twin bunks share a full bathroom with a walk-in shower. Each bedroom is thoughtfully styled for comfort and simplicity, ideal for family vacations or group getaways.<br><br>Step outside to the Gulf-front porch, where a large outdoor sofa and custom umbrellas invite you to unwind, dine alfresco, or simply enjoy the sound of the waves. With private beach access just beyond the porch, guests can transition effortlessly between the sand and the comfort of home.<br><br>Four adult bikes are provided, making it easy to explore 30A's scenic path or take a quick ride to Seaside for dining and shopping. With a perfect blend of history, modern luxury, and unbeatable beachfront views, Beach Bungalow embodies classic Seagrove charm.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
